{"id":"en_i-hired-the-real-zeus","title":"I Hired the Real Zeus","titleEn":"I Hired the Real Zeus","description":"Five years after losing his family, Roman comes back under the identity of Zeus, the Temple's unseen Lord. Elira, a defiant heiress, takes him for a mere performer and hires him to pose as Zeus, hoping this ruse will free her from a marriage she never wanted. Roman goes along with the deception, until twelve Temple Guardians bow down before him and expose the truth: the man she believed to be a counterfeit deity is in fact the genuine Zeus. For those who want to follow this series, Dramzio is one place where it can be watched.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-hired-the-real-zeus/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-hired-the-real-zeus/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comeback","Elite","Feel-Good","Hidden Identity","Male","Mistaken Identity"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-hired-the-real-zeus_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-hired-the-real-zeus_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-hired-the-real-zeus_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf7u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-hired-the-real-zeus_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf7u/?pub=4occ